From: Arcadyan FG360 build <noreply@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] containerd: disable the managed opt plugin

The managed opt plugin creates /opt/containerd/bin and
/opt/containerd/lib and prepends them to PATH and LD_LIBRARY_PATH.  The
FG360 installs its runtime and shim through opkg and reserves /opt as the
user_data mount, so this optional binary-image installation mechanism is
not used.

Keep ctr and the client install API intact, but do not register the opt
service in the containerd daemon.

--- a/cmd/containerd/builtins/builtins.go
+++ b/cmd/containerd/builtins/builtins.go
@@ -42 +41,0 @@ import (
-	_ "github.com/containerd/containerd/v2/plugins/services/opt"
